storage.description:
**Own device cache:** {cache}

**Own BE WAVE error log:** {own_log}

**Local Home Assistant log files (read only):** {ha_log}

Retention applies only to this connection’s optional cache and error log. Old data is pruned on startup and hourly. At the size limit, oldest log entries are discarded first. By default only a small device cache is kept; own logging is off. Only warnings and errors may be stored, never routine MQTT payloads.

Clearing the cache preserves devices, current live states and intentionally removed-device exclusions. Home Assistant system logs, journals and the history database are not cleared.
